import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CertaintyLegend from '../components/CertaintyLegend.astro';
---
<Base title="How We Check Our Facts | Cassian Creed" description="What the &ldquo;3+ sources agree,&rdquo; &ldquo;2 sources agree&rdquo; and &ldquo;1 source&rdquo; badges mean, and how we count sources before we publish a fact.">
  <section class="wrap hw">
    <h1>How we check our facts</h1>
    <p>Trust comes first. Every date, charge, verdict and air time on this site is tied to a source, and the badge next to it tells you how many we have.</p>
    <CertaintyLegend />
    <h2>How we count</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>3+ sources agree:</strong> three or more independent sources agree, or we have the official court record.</li>
      <li><strong>2 sources agree:</strong> two independent sources agree. We say who reported it.</li>
      <li><strong>1 source:</strong> one source so far (a reprint of the same report counts as one). We keep it visible, label it, and look for a second.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Two listings that come from the same outlet count as one source. If sources disagree, we say so instead of picking a winner. People who are charged or accused are presumed innocent unless and until proven guilty. If we get something wrong, <a href="/corrections-policy/">we correct it</a>.</p>
    <h2>How we use AI</h2>
    <p>Our research is AI-assisted and overseen by humans. Where AI helped write or check a page, we say so. Read more on <a href="/about/">our About page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Where to go next</h2>
    <p>Start free and go as deep as you want. You never have to buy anything to read the facts.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="/guides/">Free explainers and guides</a>: how courts, evidence and DNA work, in plain words.</li>
      <li><a href="/books/">Paid case guides</a>, when you want one case laid out in full.</li>
      <li>The book on a case, where we have one, on the same <a href="/books/">books page</a>.</li>
      <li><a href="/books/jury-chess/">Jury Chess</a>, our book on how criminal jury trials actually work.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="hw-note">We do not put a sales message next to a case where a child died. We only offer products we would stand behind.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
